<h2>Why the Grilled Chicken Sandwich Is the Healthiest DQ Sandwich</h2>
<p>The Grilled Chicken Sandwich wins on nutrition across the board. Flame-grilling rather than frying means significantly less fat — 9g of total fat vs. 22g in the Crispy Chicken Sandwich. At 390 calories, it is lighter than even the Original Cheeseburger (400 cal), which makes it the best choice for guests who want a full sandwich while managing calorie intake. Browse all DQ sandwich options on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>
