<h2>What's on the Grilled Chicken Sandwich</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Flame-grilled chicken breast</strong> — Marinated and grilled, not breaded or fried</li>
  <li><strong>Lettuce</strong> — Crisp iceberg or romaine</li>
  <li><strong>Tomato</strong> — Fresh slice</li>
  <li><strong>Honey mustard</strong> — Sweet-tangy sauce, lighter than mayo-based options</li>
